{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥、誕生日おめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余白選抜なら余裕でセンター\nとか自虐を言ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/10/0904796/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい\n余白うまったー！\n顔濃くなったよ！\nわーいわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ポジティブってこういう事でしょうか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことでみなさん\n初森べマーズ見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の役名は「翼馬カケル」です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリガナをふると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペガサス カケルです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか学校の先生が\n最近の子供の名前が読みにくくて困ってる\nって話を思い出したよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/10/0904796/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、気づいてる方もいたけど\n悪役の笑い方ができないと\nNogiroomで言っていた中田が頑張りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/10/0904796/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影現場では\nスタッフさんも優しかったし\n楽しかったです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいい経験ができて良かった"},{"type":"im